<title>FRANCE: Breakdown of French wheat export bids.</title>
<headline>Breakdown of French wheat export bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain traders gave the following cumulative breakdown for European Union soft wheat export bids submitted via France on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Cumulative tonnage	Refund (Ecus/tonne)</p>
<p>	6,000		     11.91</p>
<p>     73,000		     13.74 or less</p>
<p>    148,000		     13.97 or less</p>
<p>    213,000		     14.47 or less</p>
<p>    367,000		     14.99 or less</p>
<p>    387,000		     15.40 or less</p>
<p>    473,000		     16.00 or less</p>
<p>    584,350		     19.93 or less</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
